---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Coil"
  description="A small, statically typed scripting language."
  ogImage="/og-home.png"
>
  <h1 class="hero">A small, statically typed scripting language.</h1>

  <div class="stack">
    <p>
      Download Coil.
      <a href="https://github.com/ardax-corp/coil-lang/releases"
        >GitHub Releases</a
      >, or the latest
      <a href="https://github.com/ardax-corp/coil-lang/actions">release-binaries</a>
      build. There is no versioned release yet.
    </p>
    <p>
      Coil uses Hindley–Milner inference. Source files use <code>.hy</code>.
      Compiled archives are <code>.hyc</code>.
    </p>
    <p>The <code>coil</code> CLI is the command for the language.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://github.com/ardax-corp/spool">spool</a> is a git-based
      library dependency manager for Coil.
    </p>
  </div>

  <pre><code>.hy      source
.hyc     compiled archive
coil     CLI
spool    library dependencies</code></pre>
</Base>
